  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.SurrealDBOASIS v2.0.2\n\nSurrealDB OASIS Provider — multi-model database (document + graph + relational) for OASIS holons and avatars via SurrealDb.Net SDK. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.1\n- Automate coordinated OASIS platform releases (7ed2053)\n- docs(packages): add missing NuGet guides and release setup sections (77c65ea)\n- feat(providers): add CockroachDB, Neon, SurrealDB, RavenDB, Cassandra, CloudflareD1, Convex, and Fauna OASIS storage providers (1ff902e)\n- fix: put every project in a solution and fix the bugs that exposed (4612aa0)\n- fix(packaging): explicitly include newly documented package readmes (5be30be)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.SurrealDBOASIS",
